
// Dark Skies DLC

TIObjectiveTemplate.MilestoneFulfilled.AlienInvasionPlanDiscovered=Alien Invasion Plan Discovered
TIObjectiveTemplate.MilestoneFulfilled.Summary.AlienInvasionPlanDiscovered=We have discovered the aliens' plan to invade Earth.
TIObjectiveTemplate.MilestoneFulfilled.Detail.AlienInvasionPlanDiscovered=Recent intel suggests that the aliens plan to invade Earth.

TIObjectiveTemplate.MilestoneFulfilled.AlienOvertAggression=Aliens Grow Bolder
TIObjectiveTemplate.MilestoneFulfilled.Summary.AlienOvertAggression=The aliens have abandoned subtlety.
TIObjectiveTemplate.MilestoneFulfilled.Detail.AlienOvertAggression=Recent observations indicate that the aliens no longer value a subtle approach. From here on out, we can expect them to be much more aggressive on Earth, and soon, in space as well. 

TIObjectiveTemplate.MilestoneFulfilled.AlienAwareness_Public=Alien Awareness
TIObjectiveTemplate.MilestoneFulfilled.Summary.AlienAwareness_Public=The general public is aware of the aliens.
TIObjectiveTemplate.MilestoneFulfilled.Detail.AlienAwareness_Public=Ordinary people are now fully aware that Earth is being visited by aliens.